msgid "UART 接收 DMA、双向 DMA 与电气适配"
msgstr "UART receive DMA, duplex DMA and electrical adaptation"

msgid ""
"UART 公共面继续使用 `nx_uart_port_t` 和共享只读 `nx_uart_ops_t`。实例由配置 "
"生成，调用方只保存接口和上下文。新机制按模式选择；既有 IRQ、`dma-tx`、 `irq-blocks` 的状态结构和默认 ops "
"槽数没有增加。生产代码仍为 C11，没有 heap、设备扫描、隐藏 worker 或默认 OS 锁。"
msgstr ""
"UART retains public `nx_uart_port_t` and shared read-only `nx_uart_ops_t`. "
"Configuration generates instances; callers retain only interface and "
"context. New mechanisms are selected by mode; existing IRQ, `dma-tx` and "
"`irq-blocks` state layouts and default operations-slot counts do not grow. "
"Production remains C11 without heap, device scanning, hidden workers or "
"default OS locks."

