msgstr "NORMAL DMA"

msgid "有限块，IDLE 发布稳定前缀，owner 显式 service 重启"
msgstr ""
"Finite blocks; IDLE publishes a stable prefix; the owner explicitly services"
" restart"

msgid "`dma-duplex`"
msgstr "`dma-duplex`"

msgid "DMA"
msgstr "DMA"

msgid "独立 TX/RX 引擎；接收仍有有限块重启间隙"
msgstr "Independent TX/RX engines; receive retains finite-block restart gaps"

msgid "`rx-dma-continuous`"
msgstr "`rx-dma-continuous`"

msgid "双缓冲 DMA"
msgstr "Double-buffer DMA"

msgid "两个预置目标与第三个可用替换块"
msgstr "Two preposted targets and a third available replacement block"

msgid "`dma-duplex-continuous`"
msgstr "`dma-duplex-continuous`"

msgid "双向独立引擎，连续接收使用相同贷款协议"
msgstr ""
"Independent duplex engines; continuous receive uses the same loan protocol"

msgid ""
"首批只接入 STM32F407 USART1 和 GD32F470 USART0。STM32 RX 是 DMA2 stream2 channel4，TX"
" 是 DMA2 stream7 channel4；GD32 RX 是物理 DMA1 channel2 selector4，TX 是物理 DMA1 "
"channel7 selector4。控制器编号来自芯片手册， 不能把公共 opaque resource ID 的编码当成物理 DMA "
"编号。配置必须独占 UART、 DMA 目标、向量、时钟和引脚，冲突在生成阶段拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Initial support is STM32F407 USART1 and GD32F470 USART0 only. STM32 RX is "
"DMA2 stream2 channel4 and TX DMA2 stream7 channel4; GD32 RX is physical DMA1"
" channel2 selector4 and TX physical DMA1 channel7 selector4. Controller "
"numbers come from chip manuals, not public opaque resource-ID encodings. "
"Configuration must exclusively own UART, DMA targets, vectors, clocks and "
"pins; conflicts are rejected during generation."

msgid ""
"接收块容量为 1～65535 字节。连续模式至少有三个等容量块；有限模式允许 不同容量。DMA 目标必须落在已授权、可写且 DMA "
"可到达的区域；两款芯片的 CCM 不属于接收 DMA 可达 SRAM。两款 MCU 没有 CPU D-cache，这些 provider 不执行虚构的 "
"cache clean/invalidate。以后接入带 cache 的 MCU，需要新的 域和维护合同，不能复用这里的无 cache 假设。"
msgstr ""
"Receive-block capacity is 1–65535 bytes. Continuous mode needs at least "
"three equal-capacity blocks; finite mode permits different capacities. DMA "
"targets must lie within authorized, writable, DMA-reachable regions; CCM on "
"both chips is not receive-DMA-reachable SRAM. Neither MCU has CPU D-cache, "
"and providers perform no invented cache clean/invalidate. Cache-equipped "
"MCUs need new domain/maintenance contracts rather than reuse of these cache-"
"free assumptions."

msgid ""
"RX-only 与 duplex 使用不同的只读 ops 和直接 TX 调用。TX 热路径没有运行时 `dma_transmit` 判断；RX-only"
" 链接不保留 TX-DMA ops。当前 provider 使用同一 显式选择的接收状态布局，因此 RX-only 的冷存储仍含 TX-DMA "
"基类字段；这 不是零字段开销声明。"
msgstr ""
"RX-only and duplex use separate read-only operations tables and direct TX "
"calls. The TX hot path has no runtime `dma_transmit` branch; RX-only links "
"retain no TX-DMA operations. Current providers share the explicitly selected"
" receive-state layout, so RX-only cold storage still includes TX-DMA base "
"fields; this is not a zero-field-overhead claim."

msgid "块所有权与连续接收"
msgstr "Block ownership and continuous receive"

msgid ""
"调用方初始化 `nx_stream_t` 与槽表，再通过 `nx_uart_port_rx_start` 借出。 设备负责 producer，调用方负责"
" consumer。两者不能混用普通 producer 与 `nx_stream_post_*` 预置 producer "
"API。stream、槽表、所有块和 provider 状态 互不重叠，并在成功 `rx_stop` 和外部 observer 排空前保持有效。活动 "
"TX payload 不允许与整个 RX 块池重叠。"
msgstr ""
"Callers initialize `nx_stream_t` and slots, then lend them through "
"`nx_uart_port_rx_start`. Devices own producer responsibilities and callers "
"consumer responsibilities. Ordinary producer and `nx_stream_post_*` "
"preposted-producer APIs must not be mixed. Stream, slots, blocks and "
"provider state do not overlap and remain valid until successful `rx_stop` "
"and external-observer drain. Active TX payloads must not overlap the entire "
"RX block pool."

msgid ""
"有限模式直接将 DMA 指向 caller payload，不做 CPU payload copy。TC、IDLE 或错误到达后，先撤销 UART "
"DMA request 和接收中断，再写 DMA disable。 实际 EN、request 与 interrupt "
"位回读证明静止后，才读取稳定剩余计数。 最后再次读取 DMA/UART 错误，随后执行唯一 status/data 清除顺序。可靠的 正长度前缀才能 "
"READY 发布；不可靠的前缀回退为 FREE 并记录 loss。 stop 时没有收到的空块不会假发布为成功数据。"
msgstr ""
"Finite mode points DMA directly at caller payloads without CPU payload "
"copies. On TC, IDLE or error, it first withdraws UART DMA requests and "
"receive interrupts, then writes DMA disable. Actual EN, request and "
"interrupt readbacks establish quiescence before stable remaining counts are "
"read. Finally it rereads DMA/UART errors and performs the sole status/data "
"clear order. Only reliable positive-length prefixes become READY; unreliable"
" prefixes return FREE and record loss. Stop never falsely publishes an "
"empty, unreceived block as successful data."

msgid ""
"连续模式以两个 FILLING 贷款启动双缓冲 DMA。TC 后先保留第三个 FREE 块， "
"再替换已完成的非活动目标。发布旧块前同时证明替换地址、另一个目标地址、 CT 位、EN、无新 TC/错误和旧地址从两个硬件目标中完全消失。失败不会将 "
"硬件仍可能写入的块交给 consumer；它撤源、排空并按 LIFO 撤销未来贷款。 成功发布遵守 FIFO。IRQ 不复制 "
"payload，只做有界控制和至多三个贷款处理。"
msgstr ""
"Continuous mode starts double-buffer DMA with two FILLING loans. After TC it"
" reserves a third FREE block before replacing the completed inactive target."
" Before publishing the old block, it proves replacement address, other-"
"target address, CT, EN, absence of new TC/errors and removal of the old "
"address from both hardware targets. Failure never hands potentially writable"
" memory to consumers: it withdraws sources, drains and rolls back future "
"loans in LIFO order. Successful publication follows FIFO. IRQ copies no "
"payload and performs bounded control with at most three loans."

msgid ""
"没有可替换 FREE 块时，立即停止接收写源并等待实际排空，保留 consumer 的 BORROWED "
"块。稳定的已完成块和部分块仍可发布，同时记录一次停止间隙。 不会猜测丢失字节数。失败的 disable 保留所有 producer 贷款，owner "
"后续 `service` 有界重试；这段时间调用方不能复用任何块或状态。"
msgstr ""
"Without a replacement FREE block, receive-write sources stop immediately and"
" await actual drain while retaining consumer BORROWED blocks. Stable "
"completed and partial blocks can still publish with one recorded stop gap, "
"never a guessed missing-byte count. Failed disable retains every producer "
"loan; later owner `service` retries boundedly. No block or state may be "
"reused meanwhile."

msgid ""
"TC 是标志位，不是回绕计数器。连续资格要求最坏 IRQ 延迟和目标替换时间 小于一个块的填充时间；必须按实际波特率、块大小、中断优先级、屏蔽窗口和 "
"并发 DMA 负载测量。软件检查能识别可观察的错误、目标变化与 CT 异常，不能 恢复任意多个合并的回绕。违反延迟预算时不能声称数据序列可靠，即使所有 "
"目标始终保持 FILLING 而没有侵犯 consumer 内存。"
msgstr ""
"TC is a flag, not a wrap counter. Continuous qualification requires worst-"
"case IRQ latency plus target-replacement time below one block-fill interval,"
" measured from actual baud, block size, interrupt priority, masked windows "
"and concurrent DMA load. Software detects observable errors, target changes "
"and CT anomalies but cannot recover arbitrarily many coalesced wraps. "
"Violating latency budgets prevents claims of reliable sequencing even if all"
" targets remain FILLING and consumer memory is untouched."

msgid ""
"IDLE、有限块重启和容量压力后的恢复存在接收间隙。owner 的 service 周期 也是显式资源预算。重启前观察到 UART "
"overrun/error 会在清 status/data 前 记录 loss；无错误位的间隙不能凭软件推断精确遗漏数。loss 是已观测边界， "
"不是精确 wire 字节统计。上层协议决定是否允许间隙及如何恢复。"
msgstr ""
"IDLE, finite-block restart and capacity-pressure recovery create receive "
"gaps. Owner service periods are explicit resource budgets too. Observed UART"
" overrun/error before restart records loss before status/data clear; "
"software cannot infer exact omissions in gaps without error bits. Loss "
"denotes observed boundaries, not exact wire-byte statistics. Upper protocols"
" decide acceptable gaps and recovery."

msgid "TX、停止与调用上下文"
msgstr "TX, stop and calling context"

msgid ""
"TX DMA TC 只证明 payload 已送入外设，不证明最后一位已离开引脚。TX settlement 继续等待实际 UART "
"TC；取消仍先撤源，再证明 DMA/外设排空。 RX DMA 和 TX DMA 使用不同目标与向量，二者的完成状态互不替代。"
msgstr ""
"TX DMA TC proves only payload delivery to the peripheral, not the last bit "
"leaving the pin. TX settlement still waits for actual UART TC; cancellation "
"withdraws sources before proving DMA/peripheral drain. RX DMA and TX DMA use"
" separate targets and vectors; their completions never substitute for each "
"other."

msgid ""
"`rx_start/rx_stop/service/stop` 由唯一未屏蔽的任务 executor 调用。ISR 只使用 生成器绑定的精确 IRQ "
"入口；保护区保存并恢复原中断状态。`rx_stop` 关闭 stream admission，可能返回 BUSY：已发布、已借用的块必须由 "
"consumer 正常 归还。成功必须同时满足源已撤销、引擎静止以及 outstanding 为零。关闭后 service 不重新启动 RX。完整 "
"`stop` 也先关闭 TX admission，只有 RX 排空 后才能停底层时钟。失败时不能销毁或更换 owner。"
msgstr ""
"`rx_start/rx_stop/service/stop` run on the sole unmasked task executor. ISRs"
" use only exact generated IRQ entries; protected spans save/restore incoming"
" interrupt state. `rx_stop` closes stream admission and may return BUSY: "
"published or borrowed blocks must be normally returned by consumers. Success"
" requires withdrawn sources, quiescent engines and zero outstanding loans. "
"Closed service never restarts RX. Complete `stop` first closes TX admission "
"too, and may stop underlying clocks only after RX drain. Failure prohibits "
"owner destruction or replacement."

msgid ""
"GD32 IRQ TX 取消使用共享 USART reset，额外先排空正在运行的 RX；RX EN 拒绝停止时保留 TX/RX 贷款并推迟 "
"reset。reset 后恢复已选择的硬件流控位。"
msgstr ""
"GD32 IRQ TX cancellation uses shared USART reset and first drains active RX."
" If RX EN refuses stop, TX/RX loans remain and reset is deferred. Selected "
"hardware-flow-control bits are restored after reset."

msgid "RTS/CTS 与 RS485"
msgstr "RTS/CTS and RS485"

msgid ""
"`nx_*_uart_flow_configure` 是显式可选冷配置。STM32 设置 CR3 RTSE/CTSE， GD32 设置 CTL2 "
"RTSEN/CTSEN，读回失败会回滚。它在初始化后、活动 TX/RX 开始前调用，不能修改正在运行的借用。芯片可用信号为 PA11 CTS、PA12 "
"RTS、 AF7；这些芯片事实不代表当前三块开发板已经接线或外部设备支持握手。 板级必须审核 PCB、GPIO 权限、电压、复用与 peer "
"行为再绑定。硬件 RTS 反映 UART 数据寄存器的接收状态，不代表软件块池剩余容量，不能替代协议 背压或在无 FREE 块时自动保证不丢数据。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_*_uart_flow_configure` is explicitly optional cold configuration. STM32 "
"sets CR3 RTSE/CTSE and GD32 CTL2 RTSEN/CTSEN, rolling back failed readback. "
"It runs after initialization but before active TX/RX and cannot modify live "
"borrows. Chip signals are PA11 CTS, PA12 RTS, AF7; chip facts do not prove "
"wiring on the three boards or peer handshake support. Board binding needs "
"PCB, GPIO permission, voltage, multiplexing and peer review. Hardware RTS "
"reflects UART data-register receive state, not remaining software-block "
"capacity; it neither replaces protocol backpressure nor guarantees lossless "
"operation without FREE blocks."

msgid ""
"RS485 选用 `nx_uart_rs485_state_t`、不可变 `nx_uart_rs485_config_t` 和 "
"`nx_uart_rs485_ops`，默认 UART 状态不增加 DE、timer 或 task。调用方绑定 真实 GPIO、唯一授权位、DE "
"极性、setup/hold 时间以及精确底层 provider 的 纯 TX validator。validator 与 submit/start "
"共用同一拒绝规则；它不写 GPIO、 MMIO、不 admit，也不留引用。config、两个 face、ops、context 绑定和电气 "
"事实全程不可变，所有冷事实与 mutable request/payload/control 必须分离。 同一 executor 独占底层 "
"TX；不得绕过 adapter 直接提交或修改 transport。"
msgstr ""
"RS485 selects `nx_uart_rs485_state_t`, immutable `nx_uart_rs485_config_t` "
"and `nx_uart_rs485_ops`; default UART state gains no DE, timer or task. "
"Callers bind real GPIO, a uniquely authorized bit, DE polarity, setup/hold "
"time and the exact provider's pure TX validator. Validator and submit/start "
"share rejection rules; validation writes no GPIO/MMIO, admits nothing and "
"retains no references. Config, both faces, ops/context bindings and "
"electrical facts remain immutable; all cold facts are separate from mutable "
"request/payload/control storage. The same executor exclusively owns "
"underlying TX; bypass submissions or transport changes are prohibited."

msgid ""
"拒绝发生在 DE assertion 前。接受后 DE 建立成功才开始 setup，绝对 transfer deadline 包括 setup 与 "
"wire 完成。setup 超时不启动 UART。底层实际 SETTLED 才开始 hold，随后 DE 撤销成功，adapter 删除内部 "
"payload/active 引用，再 发布外层 SETTLED。失败的 drain 或 DE 撤销保留 QUARANTINED 外层贷款与 DE "
"所有权，owner service 重试。必需 drain/hold 可以延长借用超过 transfer deadline；不能因 deadline "
"已过就提前释放内存或 DE。"
msgstr ""
"Rejection precedes DE assertion. After acceptance, setup starts only after "
"successful DE assertion; the absolute transfer deadline includes setup and "
"wire completion. Setup timeout never starts UART. Hold starts only after "
"actual underlying SETTLED; successful DE withdrawal then removes internal "
"payload/active references before outer SETTLED publication. Failed drain or "
"DE withdrawal retains QUARANTINED outer loans and DE ownership for owner-"
"service retries. Required drain/hold may extend borrows beyond transfer "
"deadlines; expired deadlines never justify early memory or DE release."

msgid ""
"setup/hold 使用 `nx_time_now_us` 的 monotonic 域；service 的最坏间隔决定 边界偏差。hold "
"保证至少声明时长，并不保证精确到时刻就撤 DE。精确波形 需求需要显式硬件 timer/电气预算，当前不会猜测收发器或提供假定时资格。"
msgstr ""
"Setup/hold uses the `nx_time_now_us` monotonic domain; worst-case service "
"gaps determine boundary error. Hold guarantees at least declared duration, "
"not exact-time DE withdrawal. Exact waveforms require explicit hardware-"
"timer/electrical budgets; this implementation invents neither transceiver "
"facts nor timing qualification."

msgid "软件证据和实板验收"
msgstr "Software evidence and board acceptance"

msgid ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 直接执行生产 provider，覆盖银行替换拒绝、CT 翻转、 地址错写、新错误到达 W1C "
"窗口、disable 拒绝、终止期间 DMA/UART 错误、 status/data 清除竞态、epoch 耗尽、双向取消、flow 配置、RS485"
" setup/hold 和 DE 失败。Native adapter 另验证真实请求生命周期。这些结果建立软件 "
"合同，不证明电气波形、总线仲裁或物理延迟。"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock directly execute production providers, covering "
"rejected bank replacement, CT flips, wrong address writes, new errors in W1C"
" windows, refused disable, terminal DMA/UART errors, status/data-clear "
"races, epoch exhaustion, duplex cancellation, flow configuration, RS485 "
"setup/hold and DE failures. Native adapters additionally verify real request"
" lifecycles. Results establish software contracts, not electrical waveforms,"
" bus arbitration or physical latency."

msgid ""
"同一 no-LTO Release RX-only 开发 fixture 的分表前后 ARM ELF 实测，STM32 text 减少 2310 "
"字节、GD32 减少 2262 字节，两者 bss 减少 8 字节。它只说明 该中间分表 fixture 的 section GC "
"成本，不能继承为最终源码、任意应用或 所有模式的预算。最终候选必须重新绑定配置、源码、ELF/map/nm 与工具身份。"
msgstr ""
"Actual ARM ELF comparison before/after table splitting in the same no-LTO "
"Release RX-only development fixture reduced STM32 text by 2310 bytes, GD32 "
"by 2262 bytes, and both bss by 8 bytes. This describes section-GC costs only"
" for that intermediate fixture, not final sources, arbitrary applications or"
" all modes. Final candidates must freshly bind configuration, sources, "
"ELF/map/nm and tool identity."

msgid ""
"终止错误修复后，同一 fixture 的新一轮生产图 ARM 链接为 STM32 text 7866 字节、GD32 text 9932 "
"字节，相对旧基线分别减少 2218、2174 字节，bss 仍 各减少 8 字节。最终十四个 mode fixture 都已链接，RX-only 的 "
"nm 中没有 任何 `nx_*_uart_dma_*` symbol，duplex 保留真实 TX-DMA 方法。该结果仍是 "
"软件开发构建证据，候选签封和实板验证分别执行。"
msgstr ""
"After terminal-error fixes, fresh production-graph ARM linking of the same "
"fixture produced STM32 text 7866 bytes and GD32 text 9932 bytes, down 2218 "
"and 2174 bytes from the old baseline; both bss reductions remain 8 bytes. "
"All fourteen final mode fixtures linked; RX-only nm contains no "
"`nx_*_uart_dma_*` symbols, while duplex retains real TX-DMA methods. This "
"remains development-build software evidence; candidate sealing and board "
"validation execute separately."

msgid ""
"当前没有连接实板，所有物理验收均未执行。实板退出条件包括：两个引擎 并行的最大 baud/负载，最坏 IRQ 与 service 延迟，目标换址和 "
"wrap 压力， consumer 长持有后的 overflow/recovery，IDLE 与最后 DMA beat 竞态，真实 TC wire "
"tail，RTS/CTS stall/resume，DE setup/hold 极性与边沿，以及反复 stop/start 后时钟、向量和 SRAM "
"贷款均排空。逐板记录 PCB 修订、探针、串口、 外部接线、逻辑分析仪原始波形和同一 ELF，未执行项不能标成通过。"
msgstr ""
"No physical boards are connected, and all physical acceptance remains "
"unexecuted. Board exit conditions include both engines' concurrent maximum "
"baud/load, worst IRQ/service latency, target-replacement/wrap pressure, "
"overflow/recovery after long consumer holds, IDLE/last-DMA-beat races, "
"actual TC wire tails, RTS/CTS stall/resume, DE setup/hold polarity/edges, "
"and drained clocks/vectors/SRAM loans after repeated stop/start. Record PCB "
"revision, probes, UARTs, external wiring, raw logic-analyzer waveforms and "
"the same ELF per board. Unexecuted items cannot pass."
